{"page":330,"verses":[{"verse_key":"21:91","surah":21,"ayah":91,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّتِىٓ أَحْصَنَتْ فَرْجَهَا فَنَفَخْنَا فِيهَا مِن رُّوحِنَا وَجَعَلْنَـٰهَا وَٱبْنَهَآ ءَايَةً لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember the one who guarded her chastity. We breathed into her from Our Spirit and made her and her son a sign for all people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّتِىٓ","en_gloss":"And she who","transliteration":"wa-allatī","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَحْصَنَتْ","en_gloss":"guarded","transliteration":"aḥṣanat","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَرْجَهَا","en_gloss":"her chastity","transliteration":"farjahā","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَنَفَخْنَا","en_gloss":"so We breathed","transliteration":"fanafakhnā","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"into her","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رُّوحِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Spirit","transliteration":"rūḥinā","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهَا","en_gloss":"and We made her","transliteration":"wajaʿalnāhā","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱبْنَهَآ","en_gloss":"and her son","transliteration":"wa-ib'nahā","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ءَايَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a sign","transliteration":"āyatan","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"for the worlds","transliteration":"lil'ʿālamīna","verse_key":"21:91"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٩١","en_gloss":"(91)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:91"}]},{"verse_key":"21:92","surah":21,"ayah":92,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ هَـٰذِهِۦٓ أُمَّتُكُمْ أُمَّةً وَٰحِدَةً وَأَنَا۠ رَبُّكُمْ فَٱعْبُدُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Messengers], this community of yours is one single community and I am your Lord, so serve Me.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"21:92"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"21